WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.020
SCP-682 Vs a Ton of Liquid Nitrogen.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:09.480
After trying and failing to kill SCP-682 via
anomalous means, Dr. Carlson wished to return

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.420
to basics and try some non-anomalous murder
methods for bringing an end to this nasty

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.420
lizard.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.570
The 682 tissue sample was successful.

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:21.570
It was frozen and shattered when struck with
a hammer, exactly as intended.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:27.510
However, when 682-proper was doused with liquid
nitrogen, its body remained frozen and dormant…

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:28.830
For about ten minutes.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:32.840
Then, it began increasing its body temperature
until it was thawed.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.550
But it didn’t stop there.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:38.980
It kept increasing its body temperature until
it was so hot that the walls of its containment

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.781
chamber began to melt.

00:00:40.781 --> 00:00:45.860
Dr. Carlson noted, “Interesting, it retained
the adaption even after it was no longer necessary.

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.409
Maybe we should be more careful.”

